===Etymology===
From {{etyl|yue}} {{term|雜碎|tr=zaap6seoi3|lang=yue|sc=ZHchar}}, literally “mixed and broken”.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{i|United States}} a [[stir-fry]] vegetable dish, served with pieces of beef or pork in a semi-thick sauce, and often soy sauce
# {{Canada}} steamed [[beansprout]]s served in a semi-thick sauce, and mixed with a choice of meat and/or vegetables

